OL,3,GNEWSADriver charged after woman killed
OL,4,Ain car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged after a
OL,7,F25-year-old woman was killed in a car
OL,8,Fcrash, police say.
OL,10,FNatasha Poore, from Evercreech,
OL,11,FSomerset, died following a collision on
OL,12,Fthe A361 in Frome on 8 April 2024.
OL,14,FJobey Jason Smith, of Chilcompton in
OL,15,FRadstock, appeared before Bristol
OL,16,FMagistrates Court on 9 October after
OL,17,Fbeing charged with causing death by
OL,18,Fdriving without due care and attention
OL,19,Fwhile over the prescribed limit for
OL,20,Falcohol.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
