OL,3,GNEWSADriver charged after woman killed
OL,4,Ain car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvon and Somerset Police said the
OL,7,F53-year-old was released on
OL,8,Funconditional bail and would appear at
OL,9,FBristol Crown Court on 11 November.
